WEBVTT

00:07.600 --> 00:08.470
Stop!

00:17.310 --> 00:20.440
Are you all right?

00:21.520 --> 00:23.550
<i>Mitsuru?</i>

00:23.550 --> 00:24.850
Excuse me.

00:25.850 --> 00:27.290
Could you let go?

00:30.630 --> 00:31.990
I-I'm so sorry.

00:32.390 --> 00:37.590
Um, are you by any chance
Tamaki Kasuga?

00:38.130 --> 00:40.830
Huh? How do you know my...

00:42.740 --> 00:45.100
That strange power you just used...

00:45.370 --> 00:47.810
Are you the fifth guardian?

00:48.180 --> 00:51.940
Yes. I'm Shinji Inukai, a first year.

00:52.710 --> 00:54.980
You must be the Tamayori princess.

00:55.150 --> 00:58.280
I'm glad you're just like I'd expected.

02:29.740 --> 02:31.210
Guys!

02:33.920 --> 02:37.120
The Five

02:33.920 --> 02:37.120
Guardians

02:36.450 --> 02:37.550
Come on.

02:37.920 --> 02:39.050
Okay.

02:40.590 --> 02:43.580
Um, it's good to see all of you again.

02:43.990 --> 02:46.550
You may not remember me.

02:47.030 --> 02:49.930
I-Is that you, Shinji?

02:52.200 --> 02:53.900
Yes, I'm back.

02:54.540 --> 02:55.640
When did you get back?

02:55.640 --> 02:56.700
Yesterday.

02:56.700 --> 03:00.300
You should've told us as soon as you got back.

03:00.480 --> 03:01.840
That's right.

03:01.840 --> 03:03.610
Stop it.

03:04.350 --> 03:06.940
It's good to see you again. You seem well.

03:08.650 --> 03:11.640
Yes, I'm back.

03:14.990 --> 03:18.990
And the girl standing over here is the Tamayori princess.

03:18.990 --> 03:22.430
Oh, yes. I'm Tamaki Kasuga.

03:22.900 --> 03:24.590
It's a pleasure to meet you.

03:25.000 --> 03:26.870
The pleasure is mine.

03:26.870 --> 03:30.500
I hope I can to continue to be of service to you.

03:31.410 --> 03:34.910
This girl's always running head first into danger,

03:34.910 --> 03:36.540
so you'd better watch out for her.

03:36.540 --> 03:38.880
She's pretty much an idiot.

03:38.880 --> 03:42.220
Things always do get messy when we take our eyes off her.

03:42.220 --> 03:45.950
Hey! Don't make him think there's something wrong with me.

03:46.250 --> 03:47.390
Wrong?

03:47.390 --> 03:49.290
It's the truth.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.760
That's right. Just the other day,

03:51.760 --> 03:54.230
when we told you to flee from a tatari gami,

03:54.230 --> 03:56.060
you ran back in to fight him.

03:56.060 --> 03:59.400
Oh, fine! I get it!

03:59.400 --> 04:03.340
Hey, Shinji, did you already eat lunch?

04:03.570 --> 04:05.710
Not yet.

04:05.710 --> 04:08.910
Then let's forget about these three morons and eat together.

04:08.910 --> 04:10.850
I'll give you half of mine.

04:10.850 --> 04:11.810
Here.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.450
Is that Mitsuru's lunch?

04:14.450 --> 04:16.380
Hey, Takuma.

04:16.950 --> 04:19.180
Calling me by my first name already?

04:21.360 --> 04:23.350
You don't deserve any more respect.

04:23.960 --> 04:26.150
Mitsuru's lunches are delicious.

04:26.290 --> 04:29.100
Yuichi, not you, too.

04:29.100 --> 04:31.830
How can you be so cool about this?

04:32.800 --> 04:35.800
She doesn't shut up, does she?

04:35.800 --> 04:38.100
Where is Kotokura?

04:38.910 --> 04:42.930
Mitsuru's doing well.
She's with Lady Baba.

04:43.950 --> 04:47.400
Is that right? With Lady Baba...

04:48.220 --> 04:52.120
After you left, she couldn't stop crying.

04:53.760 --> 04:56.690
I just hope she's doing all right.

05:00.900 --> 05:03.960
Shinji, why did you leave the village?

05:05.170 --> 05:07.940
I heard the five guardians are supposed to protect

05:07.940 --> 05:11.770
the Tamayori princess and the village seal.

05:13.270 --> 05:17.800
My guardian powers didn't manifest.

05:18.150 --> 05:20.240
I left the village to train.

05:21.980 --> 05:22.980
What?

05:22.980 --> 05:26.620
Does that mean you've learned some kind of special move?

05:26.620 --> 05:30.430
No, nothing like that,

05:30.430 --> 05:32.590
but I think I'll at least be useful now.

05:36.030 --> 05:39.830
Shinji, meet us at the gates after school.

05:40.670 --> 05:46.070
Escorting this noisy princess to the shrine will be your first job as a guardian.

05:46.370 --> 05:47.440
Okay!

05:47.440 --> 05:49.310
Who are you calling noisy?

05:52.610 --> 05:55.610
All five guardians have finally been assembled.

05:57.490 --> 05:59.890
We hadn't been able to get in touch with Shinji for a while.

05:59.890 --> 06:01.860
I wondered how he was doing.

06:02.620 --> 06:06.530
Even though you're both guardians, you didn't know where he went?

06:06.530 --> 06:11.300
Listen, the five guardians aren't the group of friends you seem to think we are.

06:11.730 --> 06:14.830
No one tells us anything except what we need to know.

06:15.640 --> 06:18.700
But you're part of the same group.

06:19.410 --> 06:21.140
Sorry to keep you waiting.

06:21.880 --> 06:23.500
You're late.

06:23.810 --> 06:24.980
I'm sorry.

06:24.980 --> 06:27.420
I'm sure you have your reasons.

06:27.420 --> 06:29.050
There's no need to apologize.

06:29.050 --> 06:30.040
What reasons?

06:31.050 --> 06:33.320
We went to go check on him.

06:33.320 --> 06:38.360
The girls were going crazy for that cute face of his.

06:38.360 --> 06:40.660
Please don't, Mahiro.

06:41.600 --> 06:44.230
I'm sure they were just excited because they don't see transfer students often.

06:49.700 --> 06:52.070
This place brings back memories.

06:52.070 --> 06:53.540
The village hasn't changed at all.

06:53.540 --> 06:55.910
I hate this boring place.

06:59.380 --> 07:02.510
This village is too small for me.

07:03.580 --> 07:07.390
I did learn one thing when I left the village.

07:07.390 --> 07:09.760
This is a good place.

07:11.890 --> 07:13.690
Hey, Shinji.

07:13.690 --> 07:18.500
I think it might have been better if you hadn't come back.

07:18.770 --> 07:20.000
What?

07:22.600 --> 07:26.410
Takuma, Shinji finally came back!

07:26.410 --> 07:28.310
Why would you say something like that?

07:28.310 --> 07:30.740
I'm just telling you what I think.

07:33.150 --> 07:35.780
I want to be useful.

07:46.130 --> 07:48.000
What's wrong with Takuma?

07:48.000 --> 07:52.520
I don't think Takuma meant any harm.

07:53.600 --> 07:55.040
What?

07:56.300 --> 07:58.270
Welcome back, everyone.

07:58.610 --> 08:01.440
Suguru, what are you doing here?

08:01.440 --> 08:04.410
I heard Inukai came back,

08:04.410 --> 08:06.310
so I've been waiting for him here.

08:06.310 --> 08:09.380
It's good to see you again, Ohmi.

08:10.080 --> 08:13.150
Welcome back. You've grown.

08:13.920 --> 08:15.090
Yes.

08:15.090 --> 08:20.130
The two of you will be coming to see Lady Baba with me.

08:20.130 --> 08:23.290
The rest of you patrol the seal like you always do.

08:24.030 --> 08:25.330
Lady Baba?

08:27.100 --> 08:32.130
It's just that I haven't seen her since I last visited the village.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.960
Really?

08:34.140 --> 08:36.610
Why does he get to go?

08:36.610 --> 08:38.980
Ohmi's our leader.

08:39.210 --> 08:41.120
It's only natural for him to accompany them.

08:41.120 --> 08:43.050
We'll be seeing you.

08:43.050 --> 08:44.990
Please stop by later.

08:52.190 --> 08:53.660
Welcome back.

08:54.000 --> 08:55.520
U-Um...

09:02.140 --> 09:04.110
Grandma...

09:24.230 --> 09:27.200
Lady Baba, I am glad you are doing well.

09:27.830 --> 09:30.230
I, Shinji Inukai, have returned.

09:30.870 --> 09:35.270
I have heard from the others, but, Shinji Inukai,

09:35.270 --> 09:38.240
I would like to hear you tell the story yourself.

09:39.340 --> 09:40.510
Yes.

09:40.510 --> 09:43.840
I had been training at the Inukami shrine,

09:43.840 --> 09:46.640
but I could see my results were limited.

09:47.450 --> 09:50.720
As the Onikirimaru seal was fading,

09:50.720 --> 09:53.880
I had to fulfill my duty to protect the village.

09:54.290 --> 09:56.920
Your powers didn't manifest.

09:57.730 --> 10:00.460
Correct. However, if I had other powers,

10:00.460 --> 10:02.490
I thought I might be able to do something.

10:02.800 --> 10:04.100
I see.

10:15.610 --> 10:17.170
Grandma?

10:20.250 --> 10:21.220
Stop!

10:22.480 --> 10:24.380
Fall!

10:25.920 --> 10:27.050
What was that?

10:27.050 --> 10:28.180
Words.

10:29.390 --> 10:31.930
By giving his words special meaning,

10:31.930 --> 10:36.230
he has the power to control his surroundings.

10:37.230 --> 10:38.960
It is just as I heard.

10:39.670 --> 10:41.570
Welcome back.

10:42.000 --> 10:46.200
You will make a fine guardian.

10:47.140 --> 10:51.240
I may not be strong, but I will do my best to help in any way I can.

10:54.850 --> 10:56.720
Are you going to be a guardian?

10:58.420 --> 11:03.790
Yes. That's why I came back here.

11:04.190 --> 11:10.630
I know I have to welcome you as a guardian of the Tamayori princess,

11:10.630 --> 11:11.670
but I-

11:11.670 --> 11:12.790
It's all right.

11:13.800 --> 11:15.740
Thanks for your concern.

11:21.340 --> 11:23.680
I'll show you to the great room.

11:30.820 --> 11:32.510
Is something wrong?

11:32.820 --> 11:40.750
It seems like everyone's against
Shinji becoming a guardian.

11:41.300 --> 11:43.000
You're right.

11:43.000 --> 11:46.960
He is bound to his duty and cannot escape it.

11:47.800 --> 11:51.430
Perhaps that is what's going on.

11:51.570 --> 11:52.740
Huh?

11:52.740 --> 11:54.510
Whatever their reason,

11:54.510 --> 12:04.510
I think they're projecting their own desire to abandon their duty onto Inukai.

12:08.720 --> 12:12.290
<i>This village is too small for me.</i>

12:13.660 --> 12:19.360
<i>I think it might have been better if you hadn't come back.</i>

12:20.200 --> 12:23.570
<i>I don't think Takuma meant any harm.</i>

12:24.210 --> 12:29.180
<i>As the Tamayori princess, if I can seal Onikirimaru's power,</i>

12:29.180 --> 12:31.540
<i>will I set everyone free?</i>

12:34.520 --> 12:37.540
It's okay. I'll do my best, O-chan.

12:39.890 --> 12:41.890
Shinji's late.

12:41.890 --> 12:43.860
Looks like the girls have him surrounded.

12:44.690 --> 12:46.820
He always gets all the girls.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.220
U-Um...

12:50.360 --> 12:53.770
Did something happen between
Shinji and Mitsuru?

12:55.100 --> 12:57.040
What do you mean, "something?"

12:57.040 --> 13:01.600
I just thought they seem alike.

13:02.310 --> 13:07.040
Things seemed a little heavy when they met again.

13:07.280 --> 13:12.220
Those two were pretty close before he left.

13:12.620 --> 13:17.090
There would be a lot of reasons to think there's something going on.

13:17.090 --> 13:18.430
Oh, yeah!

13:18.430 --> 13:22.260
Shinji was forced into going out with Mitsuru.

13:22.260 --> 13:26.270
Yes, and you were always upset,

13:26.270 --> 13:27.330
saying you were the odd man out.

13:27.330 --> 13:32.240
You idiot! I was just trying to build teamwork!

13:33.610 --> 13:35.740
Sorry I'm late!

13:37.850 --> 13:40.150
Is something wrong?

13:40.150 --> 13:42.910
No, we were just talking about you and Mitsuru.

13:43.250 --> 13:47.310
Mitsuru became quite the looker, didn't she?

13:47.620 --> 13:49.960
Um, really?

13:49.960 --> 13:54.900
I-I mean, Tamaki is beautiful as well.

13:55.430 --> 13:57.060
What?

13:58.830 --> 14:01.540
Shinji, you've got poor taste.

14:01.540 --> 14:02.500
Yeah.

14:02.500 --> 14:03.400
Definitely.

14:04.940 --> 14:06.810
I don't need this!

14:08.040 --> 14:10.140
You, too, Shinji?

14:10.140 --> 14:11.450
Oh, sorry.

14:11.450 --> 14:13.310
Now that everyone's here...

14:13.650 --> 14:15.120
What is that?

14:15.680 --> 14:17.980
As you can see, we're drawing straws.

14:18.120 --> 14:22.020
Ohmi told us to take turns escorting Tamaki starting today.

14:22.120 --> 14:25.830
The others will strengthen the seal.

14:25.830 --> 14:27.160
You heard him.

14:27.390 --> 14:28.830
I'll take this one.

14:28.830 --> 14:29.920
I will take this one.

14:30.400 --> 14:31.800
Shinji, you, too.

14:31.800 --> 14:32.790
Okay.

14:34.030 --> 14:35.530
Let's go.

14:39.470 --> 14:40.810
What's your-

14:42.710 --> 14:44.040
Is something wrong?

14:46.510 --> 14:49.280
No, nothing.

14:52.890 --> 14:54.820
Cleaning Duty

14:52.890 --> 14:54.820
Kasuga Kagawa

14:54.260 --> 14:56.020
You're the class officer today, right?

14:56.690 --> 14:57.890
I'm going on ahead.

14:57.890 --> 14:58.880
Okay.

15:02.400 --> 15:05.200
I wonder what that pain was.

15:05.200 --> 15:08.170
Is something wrong? You're sighing a lot.

15:08.170 --> 15:10.100
It's nothing.

15:10.100 --> 15:12.010
I know, it's love!

15:12.010 --> 15:13.840
What? No way.

15:13.840 --> 15:15.410
Are you sure?

15:15.410 --> 15:19.540
Why don't you tell me all about it?

15:21.080 --> 15:23.580
K-Kiyono, what is that?

15:23.580 --> 15:26.140
Oh, right. I can't today.

15:28.460 --> 15:30.390
This is my side job.

15:30.390 --> 15:32.890
Your job? That doll?

15:32.890 --> 15:36.520
Yeah, I'm staying with my uncle now, though.

15:36.930 --> 15:38.900
He's worthless.

15:39.130 --> 15:41.860
I have to sell these just to put food on the table.

15:43.800 --> 15:46.100
K-Kiyono...

15:46.240 --> 15:49.180
Well, that's life. Can't help it.

15:49.410 --> 15:52.110
Let's walk home together sometime!

15:56.250 --> 15:58.410
I should get going.

16:01.460 --> 16:03.120
You're late.

16:06.160 --> 16:07.220
What's wrong?

16:08.130 --> 16:09.960
You don't look well.

16:10.330 --> 16:12.270
It's nothing.

16:12.270 --> 16:14.440
There's no way there's nothing wrong with you.

16:14.440 --> 16:16.440
I don't know why, but...

16:16.440 --> 16:17.640
Ow!

16:17.640 --> 16:20.410
I don't know what you're hiding,

16:20.410 --> 16:22.540
but it's my job to protect you.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.310
You can tell me anything.

16:28.920 --> 16:31.410
There's something coming from over there.

16:32.790 --> 16:34.080
Is it the seal?

16:39.090 --> 16:41.100
There is something,

16:41.100 --> 16:44.930
but I would have missed it if you hadn't mentioned it.

16:45.670 --> 16:47.300
You stay here.

16:47.300 --> 16:49.340
No, I'll go with you.

16:49.340 --> 16:50.960
I want to help.

16:52.640 --> 16:53.730
Fine.

16:56.180 --> 16:57.940
Tamaki, Onizaki.

16:59.380 --> 17:00.810
Ohmi, the seal!

17:02.180 --> 17:05.450
The others should already be on their way.

17:06.850 --> 17:08.020
Tamaki?

17:09.520 --> 17:12.360
This way. Someone's trying to...

17:13.360 --> 17:15.190
Takuma, wait!

17:16.530 --> 17:17.730
I'm coming, too.

17:17.730 --> 17:18.760
Very well.

17:22.300 --> 17:26.500
Another barrier. They must be even stronger up ahead.

17:27.070 --> 17:28.170
Yeah.

17:38.720 --> 17:40.980
Tamaki, stay here.

17:41.760 --> 17:42.950
Okay.

17:43.760 --> 17:47.320
Hey! You're not allowed in there!

17:52.730 --> 17:54.360
Demons?

17:54.600 --> 17:56.700
You're ordinary humans.

17:57.500 --> 17:58.910
You don't want to do that.

17:58.910 --> 18:00.840
The area up ahead is a little tough for humans.

18:01.380 --> 18:04.010
We have business here.

18:04.010 --> 18:05.450
Don't try to stop us.

18:05.450 --> 18:09.450
Unfortunately, it's our job to protect this place.

18:09.450 --> 18:10.540
I see.

18:11.220 --> 18:13.080
You're guardians.

18:13.450 --> 18:14.820
Eins, don't.

18:16.560 --> 18:18.150
Looks like you found me.

18:18.460 --> 18:20.760
I guess you're not that stupid after all.

18:21.530 --> 18:23.390
An incarnation of a crow.

18:23.860 --> 18:24.850
What?

18:26.430 --> 18:28.660
What a delicious looking soul.

18:33.710 --> 18:37.370
Zwei, looks like they have some friends over here.

18:39.580 --> 18:41.380
Leave, old man.

18:42.320 --> 18:45.750
My name isn't "old man."

18:45.890 --> 18:48.220
My friends call me Drei.

18:49.160 --> 18:50.660
Who are you?

18:50.660 --> 18:53.460
We work for the holy Monado.

18:53.890 --> 18:58.260
You should be careful you don't get yourselves killed.

18:59.000 --> 19:00.100
Kill...

19:00.100 --> 19:05.370
As guardians of this place, we will not allow such a thing.

19:06.770 --> 19:09.140
What a good looking man.

19:09.680 --> 19:12.770
Eins, I agree with him.

19:13.010 --> 19:15.140
That's too bad, Vier.

19:15.950 --> 19:18.380
We have to protect ourselves from harm.

19:31.330 --> 19:35.000
Stop!

19:45.480 --> 19:47.910
Go home. Go home!

19:49.180 --> 19:51.580
What a strange spiritual presence.

19:52.150 --> 19:57.680
How interesting. I couldn't ask for better test subjects.

19:57.890 --> 19:59.090
That's enough.

20:01.960 --> 20:04.160
Monado has forbidden us to fight.

20:08.340 --> 20:10.330
Let's play another time.

20:22.320 --> 20:23.980
They left.

20:25.520 --> 20:27.040
Are you stupid?

20:28.360 --> 20:31.330
I told you to stop putting yourself in danger!

20:32.230 --> 20:34.490
You crossed the line.

20:34.490 --> 20:37.460
They're right. You're too careless.

20:38.330 --> 20:39.320
But...

20:40.330 --> 20:42.130
I couldn't stand by and not say anything.

20:43.370 --> 20:46.240
I didn't want to be the only one doing nothing.

20:46.240 --> 20:50.340
If I'm the Tamayori princess, I...

20:54.110 --> 20:55.640
Thank you.

20:57.080 --> 21:02.250
Stepping into such a dangerous situation must have required great courage.

21:04.060 --> 21:07.690
You really are a reckless princess.

21:08.230 --> 21:09.220
Unbelievable.

21:10.760 --> 21:12.760
Thanks, guys.

21:25.110 --> 21:27.710
Come on, get up.

21:31.490 --> 21:33.010
Let's go home.

23:16.990 --> 23:18.830
Those people yesterday...

23:18.830 --> 23:21.660
Eins, Zwei, Drei, Vier...

23:23.030 --> 23:27.030
are German for one, two, three, and four.

23:27.030 --> 23:29.970
That means they're all part of one team.

23:43.550 --> 23:46.040
I'm glad we got to meet today.

23:46.920 --> 23:49.890
I'd be even happier if we could meet again.

23:51.590 --> 23:54.820
I'll be right here.

23:56.100 --> 24:00.930
Next time: Holy Woman's Advent
